# Copy this directory's contents (minus the .example suffixes) into
# secrets/nas-secrets-usb/ to bake them into the installer image at build
# time: `nix build --impure .#packages.x86_64-linux.installer-iso`
# (hosts/installer/installer-image.nix). This one file's layout is FLAT
# (authorized_keys, not home/<user>/.ssh/authorized_keys) — deliberately
# different from ../extra-files/'s nested-by-real-path tree, since the
# wizard's admin username is chosen at install time, not known here. See
# hosts/installer/wizard/stages/70-secrets.sh's own header comment for
# the full flat layout this directory mirrors.
